accepted('d480fb045a964456bc75','native-thrown-trident-physical-stack-and-loyalty-return-recovery','ThrownTrident read/write/tick/tryPickup/getPickupItem','full physical Trident ItemStack, DealtDamage and superclass projectile identity','stored item restored before deriving loyalty; pickup returns copy of original durability/enchantment/tag payload','Full pair and consumers read. Owned loyalty noPhysics return can add recovered original stack to owner inventory; invalid return owner drop uses getPickupItem. DealtDamage preserves already performed attack state separate from remaining weapon payload. Distinct thrown equipment owner, not generic arrow ownership boolean fix.','Absent Trident leaves new vanilla default stack, invalid current tag can become EMPTY. Owner superclass lifecycle not fully studied in this batch. Invalid-owner drop return ignored before discard; no claim all void/death/drop paths lossless.'),
